# ArrNexus v9.3.0-beta does not require an .env file for normal deployment.
# Deploy the Docker Compose/Portainer stack, browse to http://HOST:8484,
# create the administrator, then configure Connections/Settings in the UI.
# AIOStreams URL/UUID/password and other service credentials are stored in
# ArrNexus persistent /data through the UI. Environment variables remain
# optional legacy/bootstrap fallbacks only.
